@baseUrl = http://localhost:59244

### Read records incrementally. Use curl --no-buffer when this client buffers responses.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=5&intervalMilliseconds=250
Accept: application/x-ndjson

### Maximum record count, without scheduled delays
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=100&intervalMilliseconds=0

### Invalid combined duration returns HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=100&intervalMilliseconds=1000

### Invalid record count returns HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/stream?chunks=0

### Create a synthetic order. Use one backend or a gateway route pinned to one backend.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-00000001

{"product":"sample-widget","quantity":2}

### Replay the same semantic request. Expect the same 201 body and Idempotency-Replayed: true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-00000001

{"quantity":2,"product":"sample-widget"}

### A conflicting payload returns 409 during the five-minute retention period.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-00000001

{"product":"sample-widget","quantity":3}

### Replace this ID with the creation response ID. Unknown and expired IDs return 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Non-synthetic products are invalid.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-00000002

{"product":"unknown-product","quantity":1}

### Unknown properties are rejected, including customer data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/local-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-00000002

{"product":"sample-widget","quantity":1,"customer":"synthetic-only"}

### Inspect the API document in Development or the orchestrated sample profile.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
